### Generate tokens first, e.g. in PowerShell:
###   .\scripts\new-dev-token.ps1 -Role TENANT_ADMIN -TenantId 1
###   .\scripts\new-dev-token.ps1 -Role TENANT_USER  -TenantId 1
###   .\scripts\new-dev-token.ps1 -Role SUPER_ADMIN
### and paste them below.
@base = http://localhost:8082/api/v1
@adminToken = PASTE_TENANT_ADMIN_TOKEN
@userToken = PASTE_TENANT_USER_TOKEN
@superToken = PASTE_SUPER_ADMIN_TOKEN

### What did the service resolve from my token?
GET {{base}}/context
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Create member
POST {{base}}/members
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Jane",
  "lastName": "Doe",
  "email": "jane.doe@example.com",
  "memberNumber": "M1001",
  "dateOfBirth": "1985-04-12",
  "carrierHqCode": "MBR01"
}

### Search members (tenant user, read-only)
GET {{base}}/members?q=doe&page=0&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### Tenant user CAN create
POST {{base}}/members
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "firstName": "John", "lastName": "Smith", "email": "john.smith@example.com" }

### Tenant user cannot deactivate -> 403
DELETE {{base}}/members/2
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### Tenant user cannot see membership history -> 403
GET {{base}}/members/1/groups?includeHistory=true
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### Tenant admin deactivates and reactivates
DELETE {{base}}/members/2
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###
POST {{base}}/members/2/reactivate
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Create group
POST {{base}}/groups
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "groupNumber": "G100", "groupName": "Employees", "groupDesc": "Default employee group" }

### Add member 1 to group 1
POST {{base}}/groups/1/members
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "memberId": 1 }

### Group members
GET {{base}}/groups/1/members
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Member's groups incl. history
GET {{base}}/members/1/groups?includeHistory=true
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Remove member from group
DELETE {{base}}/groups/1/members/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Super admin -> 403 (tenant management only)
GET {{base}}/members
Authorization: Bearer {{superToken}}

### No token -> 401
GET {{base}}/members
